That completes this unit. Next up: Algebra
I, Unit 2: Linear Equations. If this

339
00:23:08,127 --> 00:23:12,928
helped, subscribe to School STEM,
Explained, and turn on notifications so

340
00:23:12,928 --> 00:23:14,111
you don't miss it.

